    <node id="n16">
      <data key="d4" xml:space="preserve"/>
      <data key="d5" xml:space="preserve"><![CDATA[research career category
This class extends the class bido:CategorialData with specific categories describing the research career of people.
Each of such categories is characterised by four specific dimensions: the research period considered, the curve of the choosed citation distribution, the slope of such curve, and the order of magnitude of the citation of such research period.]]></data>
